<li>S-2 (Master of Law) University of Technology, Sydney, Australia, 1990</li>
<li>S-2 (Magister Hukum) Universitas Gajah Mada, Yogyakarta</li>
<li>S-3 (Doktor) Fakultas Hukum Universitas Padjadjaran, 2011</li>
